### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('async()=>{const wait=ms=>new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,ms));if(!matchMedia(\'(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\').matches)throw Error(\'Native reduced-motion media absent\');const latest=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\'button\')).find(b=>b.textContent===\'Latest\');latest.click();await wait(100);if(document.getAnimations().some(a=>a.playState===\'running\'))throw Error(\'Reduced animation active\');return {direction:\'instrument\',nativeReducedMotion:true,activeAnimations:0};}');
```

